@startuml SD_US101
autonumber
title Sequence Diagram - US101: Register an Aircraft Model

actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Postman / UI" as UI
box "AISafe Backend (Spring Boot)" #LightCyan
participant "AircraftModelController" as Ctrl
participant "CreateAircraftModelDTO" as DTO
participant "AircraftModelService" as Service
participant "AircraftModel" as Domain
participant "AircraftModelRepository" as Repo
end box
database "H2 Database" as DB

Actor -> UI: Inputs Aircraft Model details (manufacturer, modelName, etc.)
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/aircraft-models (JSON)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> DTO**: creates and @Validates
activate DTO
DTO --> Ctrl: dto
deactivate DTO

Ctrl -> Service: createAircraftModel(dto)
activate Service

Service -> Domain**: new AircraftModel(manufacturer, modelName, fuelCapacity, maxRange, cruisingSpeed)
activate Domain
Domain --> Service: newModel
deactivate Domain

Service -> Repo: save(newModel)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO aircraft_model...
activate DB
DB --> Repo: Returns saved entity (with ID)
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: savedModel
deactivate Repo

Service --> Ctrl: savedModel
deactivate Service

Ctrl --> UI: 201 Created (JSON representation)
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> Actor: Displays Success Message & Details
deactivate UI

@enduml